# p_3e7a — Standard commute, Ines works from the office floor (fork of p_a3f7)

Fork of p_a3f7. The single sighting of laptop_ines places it on floor_o_o1, not on the desk. Ines apparently works sitting on the office floor (or propped up beside the desk) rather than at desk_o1. Everything else in the parent holds: Elena commutes 8:00–17:30 carrying her laptop, keys, wallet, jacket, and backpack; Ines stays home all day in the office room. The resident sighting (Ines in the office at 18:00 Tuesday) is consistent with her winding down at the office floor.

What changed from the parent: laptop_ines target moved from desk_o1 to floor_o_o1 for weekday work hours (9:00–17:30). The 12:00–13:00 "sometimes on floor" block is removed because the floor IS the primary work spot now. Claims updated to test the floor location.

